    <description>A user has been created or assigned to a new department. Let&apos;s do their license assignments
05/04/26: SS-13168 Adding decision for finding User Permission Mapping and updating User Record if not found
07/17/25: SS-11266: Added User permissions mapping for Groove licenses.
SS-12873 Removed changes to Dept and profile when no Dept match is found
05/02/25: SS-10526: Removing provision of PSG, Conga, Conga AA, CPQ and CPQ AA.
6/14/24: Adding AA License Assignment, then Subflow to assign Permission set after the license is assigned.
10/4/23: When Department doesn&apos;t match, assign Read Only Profile and send email to update User.</description>
